    {
      "id": "catalog_svc_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 225,
      "y": 335,
      "width": 316.40625,
      "height": 156,
      "text": "Postgres + Redis + gRPC server\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nREST  /api/v1/products  (paginated)\nREST  /api/v1/products/search  (rate-limited)\nREST  POST/PUT  (seller-only, JWT)\ngRPC  GetProduct, ReserveStock\n\nHandlers: Create / Update / GetById /\n  GetAll / Search / ReserveStock\nIProductCache  (HybridCache L1+L2 on GetById)",
      "originalText": "Postgres + Redis + gRPC server\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nREST  /api/v1/products  (paginated)\nREST  /api/v1/products/search  (rate-limited)\nREST  POST/PUT  (seller-only, JWT)\ngRPC  GetProduct, ReserveStock\n\nHandlers: Create / Update / GetById /\n  GetAll / Search / ReserveStock\nIProductCache  (HybridCache L1+L2 on GetById)",
      "fontSize": 12,
