    {
      "id": "notify_svc_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1684.6891096348659,
      "y": 335,
      "width": 246.09375,
      "height": 202.8,
      "text": "Stateless \u00b7 no DB \u00b7 no outbox\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nConsumes 3 exchanges:\n  order-events\n  payment-events\n  shipping-events\n\nEach event handler returns\nSendNotificationRequest \u2192\nWolverine cascades to\nSendNotificationHandler \u2192\nINotificationSender (console / SES)",
      "originalText": "Stateless \u00b7 no DB \u00b7 no outbox\n\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\u2500\nConsumes 3 exchanges:\n  order-events\n  payment-events\n  shipping-events\n\nEach event handler returns\nSendNotificationRequest \u2192\nWolverine cascades to\nSendNotificationHandler \u2192\nINotificationSender (console / SES)",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#ffffff",
