    {
      "id": "saga_panel_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1080,
      "width": 1780,
      "height": 30,
      "text": "Order placement saga  \u00b7  end-to-end walk",
      "originalText": "Order placement saga  \u00b7  end-to-end walk",
      "fontSize": 22,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#1e40af",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900001,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1899087011,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0E",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779411358330,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_1",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 858.921875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2460  Buyer (with JWT bearer) submits POST /api/v1/orders to OrderService. Endpoint validates buyer-scope: \n    JWT sub claim must match command.BuyerId, else 403.",
      "originalText": "\u2460  Buyer (with JWT bearer) submits POST /api/v1/orders to OrderService. Endpoint validates buyer-scope: \n    JWT sub claim must match command.BuyerId, else 403.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900003,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 812424579,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0F",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414704664,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_2",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 214.8527208591065,
      "y": 1184.701109978775,
      "width": 891.734375,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2461  PlaceOrderHandler calls CatalogService over gRPC, once per line: GetProduct (validate exists + available \n    + stock) then ReserveStock (xmin token enforces atomicity).",
      "originalText": "\u2461  PlaceOrderHandler calls CatalogService over gRPC, once per line: GetProduct (validate exists + available \n    + stock) then ReserveStock (xmin token enforces atomicity).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900005,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 2050996099,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0G",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414738242,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_3",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1240,
      "width": 842.515625,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2462  Order.Create() validates invariants. Order + lines persisted to orders-db. OrderPlacedEvent staged \n    into wolverine.outgoing_envelopes \u2014 same DB transaction. Atomic.",
      "originalText": "\u2462  Order.Create() validates invariants. Order + lines persisted to orders-db. OrderPlacedEvent staged \n    into wolverine.outgoing_envelopes \u2014 same DB transaction. Atomic.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900007,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 514606083,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0H",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414713146,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_4",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1294.8700478168587,
      "width": 842.515625,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2463  Wolverine background dispatcher reads from outgoing_envelopes, publishes OrderPlacedEvent to exchange \n    order-events on RabbitMQ. Marks PublishedAt.",
      "originalText": "\u2463  Wolverine background dispatcher reads from outgoing_envelopes, publishes OrderPlacedEvent to exchange \n    order-events on RabbitMQ. Marks PublishedAt.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900009,
      "version": 6,
      "versionNonce": 1142326669,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0I",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779414723429,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_5",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 215,
      "y": 1350,
      "width": 727.671875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2464  Two consumers receive the event in parallel: PaymentService (payment-orders) and \n    NotificationService (notify-orders) \u2014 \"order received\" email.",
      "originalText": "\u2464  Two consumers receive the event in parallel: PaymentService (payment-orders) and \n    NotificationService (notify-orders) \u2014 \"order received\" email.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900011,
      "version": 5,
      "versionNonce": 1740745795,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
