    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_6",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1125,
      "y": 1130,
      "width": 795.703125,
      "height": 117.6,
      "text": "\u2465  PaymentService OrderPlacedHandler is a cascade \u2014 returns ProcessPaymentCommand. \n    Handler checks for existing Payment by OrderId (idempotency), creates Pending Payment, calls \n    Stripe gateway via IPaymentGateway.\n\n\n",
      "originalText": "\u2465  PaymentService OrderPlacedHandler is a cascade \u2014 returns ProcessPaymentCommand. \n    Handler checks for existing Payment by OrderId (idempotency), creates Pending Payment, calls \n    Stripe gateway via IPaymentGateway.\n\n\n",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900013,
      "version": 10,
      "versionNonce": 1432537851,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0K",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779457300473,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_7",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1122.1194241682479,
      "y": 1202.3694423287736,
      "width": 826.109375,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2466  Gateway returns success or failure. Payment.MarkAsCompleted/Failed (status guard = idempotency). \n    Publish PaymentCompletedEvent or PaymentFailedEvent \u2192 payment-events.",
      "originalText": "\u2466  Gateway returns success or failure. Payment.MarkAsCompleted/Failed (status guard = idempotency). \n    Publish PaymentCompletedEvent or PaymentFailedEvent \u2192 payment-events.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900015,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 1975149499,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0L",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779457310283,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_8",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1122.1160268325575,
      "y": 1257.7972464195939,
      "width": 850.71875,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2467  payment-events fans out to 3 queues: order-payments (OrderService transitions Order Placed\u2192Paid), \n    shipping-payments (creates shipment), notify-payments.",
      "originalText": "\u2467  payment-events fans out to 3 queues: order-payments (OrderService transitions Order Placed\u2192Paid), \n    shipping-payments (creates shipment), notify-payments.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900017,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 701248603,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0M",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779457310283,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_9",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1122.2772701747679,
      "y": 1312.6360030773835,
      "width": 809.703125,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2468  ShippingService PaymentCompletedHandler cascades CreateShipmentCommand. Creates Shipment, runs \n    Dispatch() (Created\u2192Dispatched), generates tracking number. Publish ShipmentDispatchedEvent.",
      "originalText": "\u2468  ShippingService PaymentCompletedHandler cascades CreateShipmentCommand. Creates Shipment, runs \n    Dispatch() (Created\u2192Dispatched), generates tracking number. Publish ShipmentDispatchedEvent.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900019,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 1754984699,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.4,
      "index": "b0N",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779457310283,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "saga_step_10",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1121.9443806940753,
      "y": 1367.6360030773835,
      "width": 826.109375,
      "height": 39.199999999999996,
      "text": "\u2469  shipping-events fans out: order-shipping (OrderService Paid\u2192Shipped) and notify-shipping \n    (\"shipped\" email with tracking number). Saga complete.",
      "originalText": "\u2469  shipping-events fans out: order-shipping (OrderService Paid\u2192Shipped) and notify-shipping \n    (\"shipped\" email with tracking number). Saga complete.",
      "fontSize": 14,
