    {
      "id": "callout_outbox_title",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 1463,
      "width": 840,
      "height": 28,
      "text": "Wolverine transactional outbox  (Order, Payment, Shipping)",
      "originalText": "Wolverine transactional outbox  (Order, Payment, Shipping)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900031,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1543433133,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
      "boundElements": [],
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "index": "b0T",
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "updated": 1779411358330,
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "callout_outbox_body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1140,
      "y": 1497,
      "width": 786.328125,
      "height": 200.2,
      "text": "Per-service config in Program.cs:\n   opts.PersistMessagesWith{SqlServer | Postgresql}(connStr, \"wolverine\");\n   opts.UseEntityFrameworkCoreTransactions();\n   opts.Policies.AutoApplyTransactions();\n   opts.Policies.UseDurableOutboxOnAllSendingEndpoints();\n   opts.Policies.UseDurableInboxOnAllListeners();   // consume side\n\nGuarantee:  entity write + IMessageBus.PublishAsync commit in ONE DB tx.\n   If the bus publish fails later, the entity write rolls back.  No \"order saved but PaymentService never heard.\"\n\nConcurrency-retry:  AddConcurrencyRetry()  \u2192  3 attempts  \u00b7  50ms / 100ms / 250ms backoff on DbUpdateConcurrencyException.\n   After exhaustion, message \u2192 DLQ (wolverine-dead-letter-queue metric rises).\n\nReplay/audit:  Wolverine IMessageStore  or  SELECT TOP 50 * FROM wolverine.outgoing_envelopes ORDER BY received_at DESC.",
      "originalText": "Per-service config in Program.cs:\n   opts.PersistMessagesWith{SqlServer | Postgresql}(connStr, \"wolverine\");\n   opts.UseEntityFrameworkCoreTransactions();\n   opts.Policies.AutoApplyTransactions();\n   opts.Policies.UseDurableOutboxOnAllSendingEndpoints();\n   opts.Policies.UseDurableInboxOnAllListeners();   // consume side\n\nGuarantee:  entity write + IMessageBus.PublishAsync commit in ONE DB tx.\n   If the bus publish fails later, the entity write rolls back.  No \"order saved but PaymentService never heard.\"\n\nConcurrency-retry:  AddConcurrencyRetry()  \u2192  3 attempts  \u00b7  50ms / 100ms / 250ms backoff on DbUpdateConcurrencyException.\n   After exhaustion, message \u2192 DLQ (wolverine-dead-letter-queue metric rises).\n\nReplay/audit:  Wolverine IMessageStore  or  SELECT TOP 50 * FROM wolverine.outgoing_envelopes ORDER BY received_at DESC.",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 3,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "strokeColor": "#5b21b6",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "angle": 0,
      "seed": 900033,
      "version": 3,
      "versionNonce": 1991775725,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "groupIds": [],
